    "description": "At 1025 AM PDT, Doppler radar was tracking a strong thunderstorm over\nLindsay, or 12 miles north of Porterville, moving northwest at 20\nmph.\n\nHAZARD...Wind gusts up to 30 mph and pea size hail.\n\nSOURCE...Radar indicated.\n\nIMPACT...Gusty winds could knock down tree limbs and blow around\nunsecured objects. Minor damage to outdoor objects is\npossible.\n\nLocations impacted include...\nVisalia, Lindsay, Farmersville, Exeter, Woodlake and Ivanhoe.",
